### KPI Queries

```sql
-- Total spend, impressions, and unique countries (dashboard KPI row)
SELECT
    COUNT(DISTINCT country)                         AS total_countries,
    SUM(spend)                                      AS total_spend,
    SUM(impressions)                                AS total_impressions
FROM snapchat_ads
WHERE is_zero_spend = FALSE;
```

```sql
-- Total unique ads and average targeting criteria per ad
SELECT
    COUNT(DISTINCT ad_id)                           AS total_ads,
    ROUND(AVG(target_criteria_count), 2)            AS avg_targeting_criteria,
    SUM(CASE WHEN target_criteria_count >= 2
             THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) * 100.0
        / COUNT(*)                                  AS pct_ads_two_plus_criteria
FROM snapchat_ads;
```

