### Year-Over-Year Targeting Growth Query

```sql
-- Spend per organization in 2018 vs 2019 (slope chart data)
SELECT
    organization_name,
    paying_advertiser_name,
    country,
    SUM(CASE WHEN year_of_ad = 2018
             THEN spend ELSE 0 END)                 AS spend_2018,
    SUM(CASE WHEN year_of_ad = 2019
             THEN spend ELSE 0 END)                 AS spend_2019,
    SUM(CASE WHEN year_of_ad = 2019
             THEN spend ELSE 0 END)
        - SUM(CASE WHEN year_of_ad = 2018
             THEN spend ELSE 0 END)                 AS yoy_spend_change,
    MAX(targets_minors::INT)                        AS any_minor_targeting
FROM snapchat_ads
WHERE is_zero_spend = FALSE
GROUP BY organization_name, paying_advertiser_name, country
ORDER BY yoy_spend_change DESC;
```

